{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15971","headline":"簇蚕辞 · 王建","name":"簇蚕辞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蚕欲老，箔头作茧丝皓皓。\n场宽地高风日多，不向中庭晒蒿草。\n神蚕急作莫悠扬，年来爲尔祭神桑。\n但得青天不下雨，上无苍蝇下无鼠。\n新妇拜簇愿茧稠，女洒桃浆男打鼓。\n三日开箔雪团团，先将新茧送县官。\n已闻乡里催织作，去与谁人身上着。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15971.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15971","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}